<p><strong>Best days to post:</strong> Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday typically generate the highest engagement for home service businesses. Monday mornings are competitive, and Friday afternoons see lower engagement.</p>
<p><strong>Best times:</strong> 8:00–10:00 AM and 4:00–6:00 PM local time, when homeowners are planning their day or evening.</p>
